Given the following premises and a conclusion, determine whether the conclusion logically follows from the premises.

Premises:
- exists x (Event(x) AND Happy(x))
- RisesIn(Sun, East).
- forall x (Event(x) -> Happy(x) XOR Sad(x))

Conclusion:
forall x (Event(x) -> Sad(x))

